{"id":"000VXU","title":"The Little Robot's Crayon","author":"Kainapple","solvedCount":6,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-08T15:19:29+00:00","posted":"Heute, 08:30 Uhr","rules":"Rules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nA robot is moving around the grid in an endless loop, and does the following:\n\n• Checks the digit it's standing on,\n\n• Moves that many cells forward,\n\n• Turns 90° clockwise (on the spot),\n\n• Repeat.\n\nYou can see the robot moving east, but it's not clear which cell it checked to start that move.\n\nThe robot never checks a digit that would instruct it to cross an X or leave the grid.\n\nAn X joins digits that sum to 10.\n\nA white dot joins consecutive digits.\n\nA black dot joins digits where one is double the other.\n\nThe robot shades in any white dots it walks directly over, changing them into black dots.\n\nThe robot may re-enter a cell during the loop only if it never turns in that cell.\n\nSudokuPad link\nEnjoy!\n\nExample Puzzle:","solutionCode":"Digits in row 2 that are unvisited by the robot, from left to right.","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki","XV (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/05toqchwta","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/05toqchwta","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-08T15:19:29+00:00"}